{"strongs": "H8486", "word": "תֵּימָן", "translit": "te.man", "root": "ימם", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "south, south wind", "definition": "I. תֵּימָן noun feminine Isa 43:6 south, south wind , chiefly poetic, P & Ezekiel (literally what is on the right (hand), i.e. as one faces east; see Wetzst Verhandi. d. Berl. Anthrop. Ges. 1878, 390 ) — absolute ׳ ת Zech 9:14 + 6 t. ( ׳ הַתּ only Zech 6:6 ); תֵּמָן Job 9:9 with ה locative תֵּימָ֫נָה Exod 26:18 + 12 t.; — 1. a. south, southern quarter of sky, לְתֵימָן Job 39:26 (of flight of bird); of constellations ׳ חַדְרֵי ת Job 9:9 ׳ סַעֲרוֺת ת Zech 9:14 whirlwinds of the south ; of territory, the south Isa 43:6 (opposed to צָפוֺן ), also ׳ אֶרֶץ הַתּ Zech 6:6 (opposed to אֶרֶץ צָפוֺן ); ׳ נֶגְכָּה מִקְצֵה ת Josh 15:1 southward at the end of the south , i.e. in the remotest south (of the land); — see also II. ׳ ת . \\ \\ b. with ה locative toward the south , especially in topograph. description (often with other points of compass), פְּאַת נֶ֫גְבָּה תֵּימָ֫נָה Exod 26:18 ( P ), ׳ נ ׳ ת ׳ פ Ezek 47:19 , ׳ נֶגֶב ת ׳ פ Exod 27:9 ; Exod 36:33 ; Exod 38:9 (all P ), Ezek 47:19 ; Ezek 48:28 + צלע side Exod 26:35 , ירך Num 3:29 (both P ); also Num 2:10 ; Num 10:6 ( P ); וּמִזְרָחָה ׳ יָ֫מָּה וְצָפֹ֫נָה וְת Deut 3:27 ה locative in redundant in דֶּרֶךְ תֵּימָ֫נָה Ezek 21:2 turn they face southward (|| דָּרוֺם and נֶגֶב ). 2. south wind Ps 78:26 ( קָדִים in || clause), Song 4:16 ( צָפוֺן in || clause)", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3578')\">BDB3578</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8486')\">H8486</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3577')\">BDB3577</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3579')\">BDB3579</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>תֵּימָן</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Isa 43:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,6)\">Isa 43:6</ref></sup> <highlightword>south, south wind</highlightword>, chi