> (opposed to <bdbheb>אֶרֶץ צָפוֺן</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נֶגְכָּה מִקְצֵה ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 15:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,15,1)\">Josh 15:1</ref> <highlight>southward at the end of the south</highlight>, i.e. in the remotest south (of the land); — see also II. <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ת</bdbheb>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> with <bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> locative <highlight>toward the south</highlight>, especially in topograph. description (often with other points of compass), <bdbheb>פְּאַת נֶ֫גְבָּה תֵּימָ֫נָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 26:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,26,18)\">Exod 26:18</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 47:19\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,19)\">Ezek 47:19</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נֶגֶב ת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 27:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,9)\">Exod 27:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 36:33\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(2,36,33)\">Exod 36:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 38:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,9)\">Exod 38:9</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 47:19\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,19)\">Ezek 47:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 48:28\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(26,48,28)\">Ezek 48:28</ref> + <bdbheb>צלע</bdbheb> <highlight>side</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 26:35\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(2,26,35)\">Exod 26:35</ref>, <bdbheb>ירך</bdbh